<Layout title="Enquiry privacy notice" description="How information submitted through the booking enquiry form is used.">
  <article class="page-intro wrap narrow"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</p><h1>Privacy<span class="accent">.</span></h1><p class="setup-notice">Draft notice: business contact details and retention period must be completed before this website launches.</p><h2>Booking enquiries</h2><p>The form collects your name, contact details, vehicle registration, preferred date and message so the garage can respond and arrange work. Your enquiry is delivered to the garage’s email inbox.</p><h2>Website and spam protection</h2><p>Cloudflare hosts this website and provides Turnstile spam protection. These services process technical information such as your IP address to deliver and protect the website.</p><h2>Storage and contact</h2><p>Enquiries are handled in the garage’s email system. The garage’s legal identity, privacy contact, applicable basis for processing, retention period and information about your rights will be added before enquiries are enabled.</p></article>
